            <title>[IGNITE-6922] Class can not undeploy from grid in some specific cases</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6922</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Peer class loading enable on cluster and deployment mode set as SHARED.&lt;br/&gt;
